<h2>Cubii Pro vs Cubii JR2+: Which Connected Cubii Should You Buy?</h2>
<p>If you want Cubii plus Bluetooth, these are your two options. The riding experience is the same idea: seated, quiet, magnetic, low-impact. The practical difference is that the JR2+ is the current model and the one you are most likely to find in stock with a normal warranty and return window.</p>
<p>Our advice is simple. If you find a new Cubii Pro from a reputable seller at a fair price, it is a fine buy. If you cannot, or the listing looks like an old or refurbished unit, go with the JR2+ and do not look back.</p>
